+ '},200)</script>'

+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="graph-caption"><strong>What this graph shows:</strong> A radar chart comparing data quality across six dimensions before and after the cleaning pipeline. The red area (before) shows the messy state with only 57.5% overall quality. The green area (after) shows 100% quality after systematic cleaning.</div></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-example"><div class="example-label">DATA CLEANING CHEAT SHEET</div><div class="example-body">'
+ '<strong>Detect nulls:</strong> <code>df.isna().sum()</code> | <code>df.isna().mean()*100</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Drop nulls:</strong> <code>df.dropna()</code> | <code>df.dropna(thresh=N)</code> | <code>df.dropna(subset=[...])</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Fill nulls:</strong> <code>df.fillna(value)</code> | <code>df.ffill()</code> | <code>df.bfill()</code> | <code>df.interpolate()</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Duplicates:</strong> <code>df.duplicated().sum()</code> | <code>df.drop_duplicates(subset=[...])</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Types:</strong> <code>pd.to_numeric(errors="coerce")</code> | <code>pd.to_datetime()</code> | <code>astype("category")</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Strings:</strong> <code>.str.strip()</code> | <code>.str.lower()</code> | <code>.str.replace(regex)</code> | <code>.str.extract()</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Outliers:</strong> IQR: <code>Q1 - 1.5*IQR, Q3 + 1.5*IQR</code> | Z-score: <code>|z| > 3</code> | <code>.clip(lo, hi)</code>'
+ '</div></div>'

