tr:

'<p class="l-text"><strong>Veri temizleme</strong>, yeni ba\u015flayanlar\u0131 profesyonellerden ay\u0131ran, g\u00f6sterisiz ama kritik bir beceridir. Ger\u00e7ek d\u00fcnya projelerinde zaman\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n %60\u201380\'i herhangi bir analiz veya modelleme \u00f6ncesinde verileri temizleme, yeniden \u015fekillendirme ve do\u011frulama ile ge\u00e7ecektir. Kirli veriler eksik de\u011ferler, tekrar eden kay\u0131tlar, yanl\u0131\u015f tipler, tutars\u0131z dizeler ve ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferler i\u00e7erir \u2014 ve Pandas bunlar\u0131n t\u00fcm\u00fcyle sistematik olarak ba\u015fa \u00e7\u0131kman\u0131z i\u00e7in g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc bir ara\u00e7 seti sunar.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Veri temizleme paradoksu:</strong> Veriniz ne kadar temiz olursa, modellerinizin o kadar basit olmas\u0131 yeterli olur. Veri temizli\u011fine yo\u011fun yat\u0131r\u0131m yapan ekipler, geli\u015fmi\u015f modeller ama kirli veri kullanan ekipleri genellikle geride b\u0131rak\u0131r. NLP\'de metin verilerini do\u011fru temizlemek, modeli de\u011fi\u015ftirmeden \u00f6nce bile do\u011fruluk oran\u0131n\u0131 %5\u201315 art\u0131rabilir.</div>'
+ '<div class="lesson-outcomes" style="background:rgba(200,169,110,0.06);border-left:3px solid #c8a96e;padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin:1.5rem 0;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0"><div style="font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#c8a96e;margin-bottom:0.6rem">📍 BU DERSTE ÖĞRENECEKSİN</div><ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.3rem;line-height:1.65;font-size:0.93rem;color:rgba(235,230,220,0.92)"><li>Eksik değerleri .isna() ile tespit et ve sütun başına say</li><li>.dropna(), .fillna() ve ileri/geri doldurma ile NaN\'leri sil veya doldur</li><li>.duplicated() ve .drop_duplicates() ile yinelenen satırları bul ve kaldır</li><li>IQR ve z-skoru ile aykırı değerleri tespit et; kırp, sil veya tut kararı ver</li><li>Metin sütunlarını strip, küçük harfe çevirme ve yazım düzeltmesiyle normalleştir</li><li>.astype() ile veri tiplerini dönüştür; .info() ve .describe() ile doğrula</li></ul></div>'


/* ============================================================
   SECTION 1 TR: Eksik Veriler
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">1. Eksik Veriler</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Eksik veriler (zaman damgalar\u0131 i\u00e7in <code>NaN</code>, <code>None</code> veya <code>NaT</code> olarak temsil edilir) en yayg\u0131n veri kalitesi sorunudur. Bunlar\u0131 ele almadan \u00f6nce nerede oldu\u011funu <strong>tespit etmeniz</strong>, neden eksik oldu\u011funu <strong>anlaman\u0131z</strong>, ard\u0131ndan <strong>silme</strong>, <strong>doldurma</strong> veya <strong>interpolasyon</strong> yapma karar\u0131n\u0131 vermeniz gerekir.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Tespit</div><div class="card-body">isna() / isnull() eksik de\u011ferler i\u00e7in True d\u00f6ner. notna() / notnull() ge\u00e7erli de\u011ferler i\u00e7in True d\u00f6ner. S\u00fctun ba\u015f\u0131na null sayma i\u00e7in .sum() kullan\u0131n.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Silme</div><div class="card-body">dropna() eksik de\u011ferli sat\u0131r veya s\u00fctunlar\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131r. \u0130nce kontrol i\u00e7in how, thresh ve subset parametrelerini kullan\u0131n.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Doldurma</div><div class="card-body">fillna() NaN\'lar\u0131 bir de\u011ferle, ileri-doldurma (ffill) veya geri-doldurma (bfill) ile de\u011fi\u015ftirir. Farkl\u0131 s\u00fctunlar farkl\u0131 stratejiler gerektirebilir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u0130nterpolasyon</div><div class="card-body">interpolate() do\u011frusal, polinom veya zamana dayal\u0131 interpolasyonla eksik de\u011ferleri tahmin eder. Zaman serisi verileri i\u00e7in m\u00fckemmel.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># Eksik de\u011ferlerle bir DataFrame olu\u015ftur</span>\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"isim"</span>: [<span class="str">"Alice"</span>, <span class="str">"Bob"</span>, <span class="kw">None</span>, <span class="str">"Dave"</span>, <span class="str">"Eve"</span>, <span class="str">"Frank"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"yas"</span>: [<span class="num">25</span>, np.nan, <span class="num">28</span>, <span class="num">35</span>, np.nan, <span class="num">40</span>],\n    <span class="str">"puan"</span>: [<span class="num">88</span>, <span class="num">72</span>, np.nan, np.nan, <span class="num">91</span>, <span class="num">85</span>],\n    <span class="str">"sehir"</span>: [<span class="str">"IST"</span>, <span class="str">"ANK"</span>, <span class="str">"IST"</span>, np.nan, np.nan, <span class="str">"IZM"</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- TESP\u0130T ----</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df.<span class="fn">isna</span>())            <span class="cm"># Eksik de\u011ferlerin Boolean DataFrame\'i</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df.<span class="fn">isna</span>().<span class="fn">sum</span>())      <span class="cm"># S\u00fctun ba\u015f\u0131na null say\u0131s\u0131</span>\n<span class="cm"># isim     1</span>\n<span class="cm"># yas      2</span>\n<span class="cm"># puan     2</span>\n<span class="cm"># sehir    2</span>\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df.<span class="fn">isna</span>().<span class="fn">sum</span>().<span class="fn">sum</span>())  <span class="cm"># Toplam null: 7</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># S\u00fctun ba\u015f\u0131na eksik y\u00fczde</span>\neksik_yuzde = df.<span class="fn">isna</span>().<span class="fn">mean</span>() * <span class="num">100</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(eksik_yuzde.<span class="fn">round</span>(<span class="num">1</span>))\n\n<span class="cm"># HERHANGI bir eksik de\u011feri olan sat\u0131rlar</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df[df.<span class="fn">isna</span>().<span class="fn">any</span>(axis=<span class="num">1</span>)])\n\n<span class="cm"># T\u00dcM de\u011ferleri mevcut olan sat\u0131rlar</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df[df.<span class="fn">notna</span>().<span class="fn">all</span>(axis=<span class="num">1</span>)])</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># ---- S\u0130LME ----</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">dropna</span>()                    <span class="cm"># HERHANGI bir de\u011ferin NaN oldu\u011fu sat\u0131rlar\u0131 sil</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">dropna</span>(how=<span class="str">"all"</span>)            <span class="cm"># T\u00dcM de\u011ferlerin NaN oldu\u011fu sat\u0131rlar\u0131 sil</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">dropna</span>(thresh=<span class="num">3</span>)             <span class="cm"># En az 3 ge\u00e7erli de\u011feri olan sat\u0131rlar\u0131 tut</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">dropna</span>(subset=[<span class="str">"isim"</span>, <span class="str">"puan"</span>])  <span class="cm"># Sadece bu s\u00fctunlar\u0131 kontrol et</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- DOLDURMA ----</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">fillna</span>(<span class="num">0</span>)           <span class="cm"># NaN\'lar\u0131 0 ile de\u011fi\u015ftir</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"isim"</span>].<span class="fn">fillna</span>(<span class="str">"Bilinmiyor"</span>) <span class="cm"># NaN\'lar\u0131 string ile de\u011fi\u015ftir</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># S\u00fctun ortalamas\u0131/medyan\u0131/modu ile doldur</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"yas"</span>].<span class="fn">fillna</span>(df[<span class="str">"yas"</span>].<span class="fn">mean</span>())      <span class="cm"># ortalama ile doldurma</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"yas"</span>].<span class="fn">fillna</span>(df[<span class="str">"yas"</span>].<span class="fn">median</span>())    <span class="cm"># medyan (ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferlere dayan\u0131kl\u0131)</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"sehir"</span>].<span class="fn">fillna</span>(df[<span class="str">"sehir"</span>].<span class="fn">mode</span>()[<span class="num">0</span>]) <span class="cm"># en s\u0131k de\u011fer</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># \u0130leri doldurma ve geri doldurma</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">ffill</span>()   <span class="cm"># son ge\u00e7erli de\u011feri ileri yay</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">bfill</span>()   <span class="cm"># sonraki ge\u00e7erli de\u011feri geri yay</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Farkl\u0131 s\u00fctunlar\u0131 farkl\u0131 de\u011ferlerle doldur</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">fillna</span>({<span class="str">"isim"</span>: <span class="str">"Bilinmiyor"</span>, <span class="str">"yas"</span>: df[<span class="str">"yas"</span>].<span class="fn">median</span>(), <span class="str">"puan"</span>: <span class="num">0</span>})\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- \u0130NTERPOLASYON ----</span>\nts = pd.<span class="fn">Series</span>([<span class="num">1</span>, np.nan, np.nan, <span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">5</span>, np.nan, <span class="num">7</span>])\n<span class="fn">print</span>(ts.<span class="fn">interpolate</span>())          <span class="cm"># do\u011frusal: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare">'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">NE ZAMAN S\u0130LMEL\u0130</div>'
