/* ============================================================
   SECTION 2 TR: Tekrar Eden Veriler
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">2. Tekrar Eden Veriler</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Tekrar eden sat\u0131rlar analizinizi sessizce bozar. Say\u0131lar\u0131 \u015fi\u015firir, ortalamalar\u0131 \u00e7arp\u0131t\u0131r ve ML e\u011fitim/test b\u00f6l\u00fcmlerinde veri s\u0131z\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131na neden olur. Pandas tespit i\u00e7in <code>duplicated()</code> ve kald\u0131rma i\u00e7in <code>drop_duplicates()</code> sunar; hangi s\u00fctunlar\u0131n kontrol edilece\u011fi ve hangi kopyan\u0131n tutulaca\u011f\u0131 \u00fczerinde ince kontrol sa\u011flar.</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"metin"</span>: [<span class="str">"merhaba dunya"</span>, <span class="str">"foo bar"</span>, <span class="str">"merhaba dunya"</span>, <span class="str">"baz qux"</span>, <span class="str">"foo bar"</span>, <span class="str">"yeni metin"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"etiket"</span>: [<span class="str">"poz"</span>, <span class="str">"neg"</span>, <span class="str">"poz"</span>, <span class="str">"poz"</span>, <span class="str">"neg"</span>, <span class="str">"poz"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"kaynak"</span>: [<span class="str">"web"</span>, <span class="str">"api"</span>, <span class="str">"web"</span>, <span class="str">"elle"</span>, <span class="str">"web"</span>, <span class="str">"api"</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- TESP\u0130T ----</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df.<span class="fn">duplicated</span>())          <span class="cm"># Boolean: Tekrarlar i\u00e7in True</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df.<span class="fn">duplicated</span>().<span class="fn">sum</span>())    <span class="cm"># 2 tekrar eden sat\u0131r</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Belirli s\u00fctunlarda tekrar kontrol\u00fc</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">duplicated</span>(subset=[<span class="str">"metin"</span>])  <span class="cm"># sadece \'metin\' s\u00fctununu kontrol et</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Son kopya yerine ilkini i\u015faretle</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">duplicated</span>(keep=<span class="str">"last"</span>)      <span class="cm"># \u0130LK olu\u015fumu tekrar olarak i\u015faretler</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">duplicated</span>(keep=<span class="kw">False</span>)       <span class="cm"># T\u00dcM olu\u015fumlar\u0131 tekrar olarak i\u015faretler</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- KALDIRMA ----</span>\ndf_temiz = df.<span class="fn">drop_duplicates</span>()\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">len</span>(df), <span class="str">"\u2192"</span>, <span class="fn">len</span>(df_temiz))  <span class="cm"># 6 \u2192 4</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Belirli s\u00fctunlara g\u00f6re tekrarlar\u0131 sil</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">drop_duplicates</span>(subset=[<span class="str">"metin"</span>])           <span class="cm"># benzersiz metinler</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">drop_duplicates</span>(subset=[<span class="str">"metin"</span>, <span class="str">"etiket"</span>])  <span class="cm"># benzersiz (metin, etiket) \u00e7iftleri</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- NLP PRAT\u0130K: Metin k\u00fclliyat\u0131n\u0131 tekrarlardan ar\u0131nd\u0131rma ----</span>\nkulliyat = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({<span class="str">"metin"</span>: [\n    <span class="str">"Model NLP gorevlerinde basarili."</span>,\n    <span class="str">"model nlp gorevlerinde basarili."</span>,   <span class="cm"># büyük/küçük harf farki</span>\n    <span class="str">"Model  NLP gorevlerinde basarili."</span>, <span class="cm"># fazla bosluk</span>\n    <span class="str">"Tamamen farkli bir cumle."</span>\n]})\nkulliyat[<span class="str">"normalize"</span>] = (kulliyat[<span class="str">"metin"</span>]\n    .str.<span class="fn">lower</span>().str.<span class="fn">strip</span>()\n    .str.<span class="fn">replace</span>(<span class="str">r"\\s+"</span>, <span class="str">" "</span>, regex=<span class="kw">True</span>))\nkulliyat_temiz = kulliyat.<span class="fn">drop_duplicates</span>(subset=[<span class="str">"normalize"</span>])\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">len</span>(kulliyat), <span class="str">"\u2192"</span>, <span class="fn">len</span>(kulliyat_temiz))  <span class="cm"># 4 \u2192 2</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="l-note"><strong>NLP uyar\u0131s\u0131:</strong> Metin veri setlerinde tekrarlar nadiren tam e\u015fle\u015fmedir. Tekrar kontrol\u00fc \u00f6ncesinde metni normalize edin (k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck harfe d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme, bo\u015fluklar\u0131 temizleme, noktalama i\u015faretlerini kald\u0131rma). Ayr\u0131ca <strong>yak\u0131n tekrarlara</strong> dikkat edin \u2014 bir veya iki kelime farkl\u0131 c\u00fcmleler. <code>datasketch</code> (MinHash LSH) gibi k\u00fct\u00fcphaneler yak\u0131n tekrarlar\u0131 b\u00fcy\u00fck \u00f6l\u00e7ekte tespit edebilir.</div>'

/* ============================================================
   SECTION 3 TR: Tip D\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">3. Tip D\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Pandas veri okurken s\u00fctun tiplerini s\u0131kl\u0131kla yanl\u0131\u015f tahmin eder: string olarak saklanan say\u0131lar, object olarak tarihler, tam string olarak kategoriler. Tipleri d\u00fczeltmek zorunludur \u2014 yanl\u0131\u015f tipler sessiz hatalara neden olur (orn. stringleri s\u0131ralarken "10" "2"den \u00f6nce gelir) ve bellek israf\u0131na yol a\u00e7ar.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">astype()</div><div class="card-body">Genel tip d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme. int, float, str, bool, category i\u00e7in \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Ge\u00e7ersiz de\u011ferlerde varsay\u0131lan olarak hata verir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">to_numeric()</div><div class="card-body">Ak\u0131ll\u0131 say\u0131sal d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme. errors=\'coerce\' ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lamayan de\u011ferleri \u00e7\u00f6kmek yerine NaN\'a \u00e7evirir. Kirli veri i\u00e7in \u015fart.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">to_datetime()</div><div class="card-body">Stringlerden tarih ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma. Bir\u00e7ok format\u0131 otomatik alg\u0131lar. Belirli kal\u0131plar i\u00e7in format= kullan\u0131n (daha h\u0131zl\u0131 ve g\u00fcvenilir).</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Kategorik</div><div class="card-body">pd.Categorical veya astype(\'category\'). D\u00fc\u015f\u00fck kardinaliteli s\u00fctunlar i\u00e7in (orn. cinsiyet, \u00fclke) belle\u011fi dramatik \u015fekilde azalt\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"fiyat"</span>: [<span class="str">"10.5"</span>, <span class="str">"20"</span>, <span class="str">"N/A"</span>, <span class="str">"15.3"</span>, <span class="str">"hatali"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"tarih"</span>: [<span class="str">"2024-01-15"</span>, <span class="str">"2024-02-20"</span>, <span class="str">"2024/03/10"</span>, <span class="str">"Mart 2024"</span>, <span class="str">"2024-04-01"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"gecerli"</span>: [<span class="str">"evet"</span>, <span class="str">"hayir"</span>, <span class="str">"evet"</span>, <span class="str">"evet"</span>, <span class="str">"hayir"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"kategori"</span>: [<span class="str">"A"</span>, <span class="str">"B"</span>, <span class="str">"A"</span>, <span class="str">"C"</span>, <span class="str">"B"</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- to_numeric: hatalar\u0131 zarif \u015fekilde yakalar ----</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"fiyat"</span>] = pd.<span class="fn">to_numeric</span>(df[<span class="str">"fiyat"</span>], errors=<span class="str">"coerce"</span>)\n<span class="cm"># "N/A" ve "hatali" NaN\'a d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fc</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- to_datetime: formatlar\u0131 otomatik alg\u0131lar ----</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"tarih"</span>] = pd.<span class="fn">to_datetime</span>(df[<span class="str">"tarih"</span>], errors=<span class="str">"coerce"</span>, format=<span class="str">"mixed"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- Boolean e\u015fleme ----</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"gecerli"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"gecerli"</span>].<span class="fn">map</span>({<span class="str">"evet"</span>: <span class="kw">True</span>, <span class="str">"hayir"</span>: <span class="kw">False</span>})\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- Kategori tipi (bellek tasarrufu) ----</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"kategori"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"kategori"</span>].<span class="fn">astype</span>(<span class="str">"category"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- BELLEK OPT\u0130M\u0130ZASYONU ----</span>\nn = <span class="num">100_000</span>\nbuyuk_df = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"id"</span>: np.<span class="fn">arange</span>(n),\n    <span class="str">"durum"</span>: np.random.<span class="fn">choice</span>([<span class="str">"aktif"</span>, <span class="str">"pasif"</span>, <span class="str">"beklemede"</span>], n),\n    <span class="str">"değer"</span>: np.random.<span class="fn">rand</span>(n) * <span class="num">100</span>,\n    <span class="str">"bayrak"</span>: np.random.<span class="fn">choice</span>([<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">1</span>], n)\n})\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Once:"</span>, buyuk_df.memory_usage(deep=<span class="kw">True</span>).<span class="fn">sum</span>() / <span class="num">1e6</span>, <span class="str">"MB"</span>)\nbuyuk_df[<span class="str">"id"</span>] = buyuk_df[<span class="str">"id"</span>].<span class="fn">astype</span>(<span class="str">"int32"</span>)\nbuyuk_df[<span class="str">"durum"</span>] = buyuk_df[<span class="str">"durum"</span>].<span class="fn">astype</span>(<span class="str">"category"</span>)\nbuyuk_df[<span class="str">"değer"</span>] = buyuk_df[<span class="str">"değer"</span>].<span class="fn">astype</span>(<span class="str">"float32"</span>)\nbuyuk_df[<span class="str">"bayrak"</span>] = buyuk_df[<span class="str">"bayrak"</span>].<span class="fn">astype</span>(<span class="str">"int8"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"Sonra:"</span>, buyuk_df.memory_usage(deep=<span class="kw">True</span>).<span class="fn">sum</span>() / <span class="num">1e6</span>, <span class="str">"MB"</span>)\n<span class="cm"># ~%83 azalma!</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-steps">'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">\u00d6nce dtypes kontrol edin</div><div class="step-detail">Veri y\u00fckledikten hemen sonra <code>df.dtypes</code> ve <code>df.info()</code> \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n. Say\u0131sal veya datetime olmas\u0131 gereken ancak <code>object</code> g\u00f6steren s\u00fctunlar bir uyar\u0131 i\u015faretidir.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Kirli veri i\u00e7in errors=\'coerce\' kullan\u0131n</div><div class="step-detail"><code>pd.to_numeric(col, errors=\'coerce\')</code> ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lamayan de\u011ferleri \u00e7\u00f6kmek yerine NaN\'a d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcr. Olu\u015fan NaN\'lar\u0131 fillna veya dropna ile ele al\u0131n.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Say\u0131sal tipleri k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fclt\u00fcn</div><div class="step-detail">De\u011ferler int32 veya float32\'ye s\u0131\u011f\u0131yorsa k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck tipler kullan\u0131n. ~1000\'den az benzersiz de\u011feri olan s\u00fctunlar i\u00e7in <code>category</code>\'ye d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcn.</div></div></div>'
+ '</div>'

/* ============================================================
   SECTION 4 TR: Dize Temizleme
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">4. Dize Temizleme</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Ger\u00e7ek d\u00fcnya metin verileri da\u011f\u0131n\u0131kt\u0131r: fazla bo\u015fluklar, tutars\u0131z b\u00fcy\u00fck/k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck harfler, \u00f6zel karakterler, kar\u0131\u015f\u0131k formatlar. <code>.str</code> eri\u015fimcisi d\u00f6ng\u00fc olmadan t\u00fcm s\u00fctunlar\u0131 temizleyen vekt\u00f6rize dize metotlar\u0131 sa\u011flar. Bu \u00f6zellikle NLP i\u00e7in kritiktir \u2014 kirli metni modele beslemek kirli tahminler \u00fcretir.</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"isim"</span>: [<span class="str">"  Ahmet  "</span>, <span class="str">"MEHMET"</span>, <span class="str">"  zeynep "</span>, <span class="str">"AYS\u0130E"</span>, <span class="str">" Can"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"email"</span>: [<span class="str">"Ahmet@Email.COM"</span>, <span class="str">"mehmet@email.com"</span>, <span class="str">"Zeynep@EMAIL.com"</span>,\n             <span class="str">"ayse@email.com"</span>, <span class="str">"CAN@email.COM"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"telefon"</span>: [<span class="str">"(555) 123-4567"</span>, <span class="str">"555.123.4567"</span>, <span class="str">"555-123-4567"</span>,\n               <span class="str">"5551234567"</span>, <span class="str">"+90 555 123 4567"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"yorum"</span>: [<span class="str">"Harika urun!!!"</span>, <span class="str">"N/A"</span>, <span class="str">"  iyi   hizmet  "</span>,\n             <span class="str">"KOTU deneyim"</span>, <span class="str">"Tekrar alirim :)"</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- BOSLUKLAR ----</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"isim"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"isim"</span>].str.<span class="fn">strip</span>()\ndf[<span class="str">"yorum"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"yorum"</span>].str.<span class="fn">strip</span>()\ndf[<span class="str">"yorum"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"yorum"</span>].str.<span class="fn">replace</span>(<span class="str">r"\\s+"</span>, <span class="str">" "</span>, regex=<span class="kw">True</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- HARF NORMALIZASYONU ----</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"isim"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"isim"</span>].str.<span class="fn">title</span>()\ndf[<span class="str">"email"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"email"</span>].str.<span class="fn">lower</span>()\ndf[<span class="str">"yorum"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"yorum"</span>].str.<span class="fn">lower</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- REGEX DE\u011eI\u015eT\u0130RME ----</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"tel_temiz"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"telefon"</span>].str.<span class="fn">replace</span>(<span class="str">r"[^\\d]"</span>, <span class="str">""</span>, regex=<span class="kw">True</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Tekrarlanan noktalama i\u015faretlerini temizle: "!!!" \u2192 "!"</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"yorum"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"yorum"</span>].str.<span class="fn">replace</span>(<span class="str">r"(.)\\1{2,}"</span>, <span class="str">r"\\1"</span>, regex=<span class="kw">True</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- REGEX ile CIKARMA ----</span>\npuanlar = pd.<span class="fn">Series</span>([<span class="str">"Puan: 95/100"</span>, <span class="str">"Puan: 87/100"</span>, <span class="str">"Puan yok"</span>])\npuanlar_sayisal = puanlar.str.<span class="fn">extract</span>(<span class="str">r"(\\d+)/100"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- \u0130CEREN ile F\u0130LTRELEME ----</span>\nyorumlar = pd.<span class="fn">Series</span>([<span class="str">"harika urun"</span>, <span class="str">"kotu hizmet"</span>, <span class="str">"fena değil"</span>, <span class="str">"mukemmel kalite"</span>])\nolumlu = yorumlar[yorumlar.str.<span class="fn">contains</span>(<span class="str">r"harika|mukemmel|iyi"</span>, case=<span class="kw">False</span>)]\n<span class="fn">print</span>(olumlu.tolist())</code></pre></div>'

/* --- Plotly: Before/After Cleaning (TR) --- */
+ '<div id="plot-strclean-tr" class="plotly-graph"></div>'
