+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="graph-caption"><strong>Bu grafik ne g\u00f6steriyor:</strong> Sistematik dize temizli\u011finin dramatik etkisi. Temizlik \u00f6ncesinde veri setinde 136 dize sorunu vard\u0131. strip, lower, regex replace ve format standartla\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131 uyguland\u0131ktan sonra sadece 5 u\u00e7 durum kald\u0131.</div></div>'

/* ============================================================
   SECTION 5 TR: Ayk\u0131r\u0131 De\u011fer Tespiti
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">5. Ayk\u0131r\u0131 De\u011fer Tespiti</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferler, da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n geri kalan\u0131ndan \u00f6nemli \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcde sapan veri noktalar\u0131d\u0131r. <strong>Me\u015fru</strong> olabilirler (gelir verisinde bir milyarder) veya <strong>hatalar</strong> olabilirler (negatif ya\u015f). Ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferleri k\u00f6r\u00fc k\u00f6r\u00fcne kald\u0131rmak bilgi yok eder; tutmak modelinizi bozar. Sistematik tespit y\u00f6ntemlerine ve ne yapaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131za karar vermek i\u00e7in alan bilgisine ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z var.</p>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Z-skoru ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011fer kural\u0131 \u2014 bir de\u011ferin ortalamadan ka\u00e7 standart sapma uzakta oldu\u011fu. |z| > 3 olursa ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011fer olarak i\u015faretlenir:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$z = \\frac{x - \\mu}{\\sigma}, \\qquad |z| > 3$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">z</div><div class="card-body">Z-skoru \u2014 ortalamadan standart sapma birimiyle \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fclen standartla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f uzakl\u0131k.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">x</div><div class="card-body">Ayk\u0131r\u0131 olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 test etti\u011fimiz ham g\u00f6zlem de\u011feri.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03bc, \u03c3</div><div class="card-body">S\u00fctunun ortalamas\u0131 ve standart sapmas\u0131. Her ikisi de ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferlere duyarl\u0131d\u0131r \u2014 tek bir u\u00e7 de\u011fer \u03c3\'y\u0131 \u015fi\u015firir ve di\u011fer anormallikleri gizler.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">|z| > 3</div><div class="card-body">Standart e\u015fik. Normal da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mda noktalar\u0131n yaln\u0131zca %0.27\'si \u00b13\u03c3 d\u0131\u015f\u0131na d\u00fc\u015fer \u2014 bunun \u00f6tesi \u015f\u00fcphelidir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Ne zaman</div><div class="card-body">Yakla\u015f\u0131k normal, b\u00fcy\u00fck veri setlerinde idealdir. A\u011f\u0131r \u00e7arp\u0131k verilerde \u00f6nerilmez \u2014 IQR kullan\u0131n.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>IQR kural\u0131 \u2014 normallik varsaymayan sa\u011flam ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011fer tespiti. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki e\u015fitsizliklerden biri sa\u011flan\u0131rsa x ayk\u0131r\u0131d\u0131r:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$x < Q_1 - 1.5 \\cdot \\text{IQR} \\qquad \\text{or} \\qquad x > Q_3 + 1.5 \\cdot \\text{IQR}$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Q1, Q3</div><div class="card-body">Birinci ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc \u00e7eyrekler \u2014 verinin 25. ve 75. y\u00fczdelikleri. Birlikte verinin orta %50\'sini kapsarlar.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">IQR</div><div class="card-body">\u00c7eyrekler aras\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131kl\u0131k = Q3 \u2212 Q1. Sa\u011flam yay\u0131l\u0131m \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcs\u00fc: u\u00e7 de\u011ferler \u03c3\'y\u0131 \u015fi\u015firebildi\u011fi gibi IQR\'\u0131 \u015fi\u015firemez.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">1.5 katsay\u0131s\u0131</div><div class="card-body">Tukey\'in kural\u0131. Standart i\u015faretleme i\u00e7in 1.5; "u\u00e7" ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferler i\u00e7in 3.0 kullan\u0131n.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Boxplot b\u0131y\u0131klar\u0131</div><div class="card-body">Standart boxplot b\u0131y\u0131klar\u0131 tam olarak [Q1 \u2212 1.5\u00b7IQR, Q3 + 1.5\u00b7IQR] aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 \u00e7izer. Bunun \u00f6tesi nokta olarak g\u00f6sterilir \u2014 g\u00f6rsel ayk\u0131r\u0131 tespiti.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Min-max normalizasyonu \u2014 bir s\u00fctunu [0, 1] aral\u0131\u011f\u0131na \u00f6l\u00e7ekle:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$x\' = \\frac{x - x_{\\min}}{x_{\\max} - x_{\\min}}$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">x\'</div><div class="card-body">Normalle\u015ftirilmi\u015f de\u011fer, her zaman [0, 1] aral\u0131\u011f\u0131nda. Minimum 0\'a, maksimum 1\'e e\u015flenir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">x_min, x_max</div><div class="card-body">S\u00fctundaki en k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck ve en b\u00fcy\u00fck de\u011ferler. \u0130kisi de ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferlere \u00e7ok duyarl\u0131d\u0131r \u2014 tek bir u\u00e7 de\u011fer geri kalan her \u015feyi k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fcc\u00fck bir aral\u0131\u011fa s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Z-skoru ile fark</div><div class="card-body">Min-max da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m \u015feklini korur ama ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferlere k\u0131r\u0131lgand\u0131r. Z-skoru (standartla\u015ft\u0131rma) daha sa\u011flamd\u0131r ve ML\'de genelde varsay\u0131land\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Kullan\u0131m</div><div class="card-body">G\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fc piksel \u00f6l\u00e7eklemesi, s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 girdi bekleyen sinir a\u011flar\u0131, [0, 1] \u00f6l\u00e7e\u011finde \u00f6zniteliklere bakan modeller.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare">'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">IQR Y\u00d6NTEM\u0130 (Dayan\u0131kl\u0131)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Q1 = 25. y\u00fczdelik, Q3 = 75. y\u00fczdelik</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">IQR = Q3 - Q1</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">x < Q1 - 1.5*IQR veya x > Q3 + 1.5*IQR ise ayk\u0131r\u0131</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">\u00c7arp\u0131k da\u011f\u0131l\u0131mlar i\u00e7in iyi \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r</div></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">Z-SKORU Y\u00d6NTEM\u0130 (Parametrik)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">z = (x - ortalama) / std</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">|z| > 3 ise ayk\u0131r\u0131 (veya 2.5, 2)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Yakla\u015f\u0131k normal da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m varsayar</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Ortalama/std\'deki a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferlere duyarl\u0131</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\nnp.random.<span class="fn">seed</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"maas"</span>: np.<span class="fn">concatenate</span>([\n        np.random.<span class="fn">normal</span>(<span class="num">50000</span>, <span class="num">10000</span>, <span class="num">97</span>),  <span class="cm"># normal maaslar</span>\n        [<span class="num">200000</span>, <span class="num">350000</span>, <span class="num">5000</span>]               <span class="cm"># aykiri değerler</span>\n    ])\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- IQR YONTEM\u0130 ----</span>\nQ1 = df[<span class="str">"maas"</span>].<span class="fn">quantile</span>(<span class="num">0.25</span>)\nQ3 = df[<span class="str">"maas"</span>].<span class="fn">quantile</span>(<span class="num">0.75</span>)\nIQR = Q3 - Q1\nalt = Q1 - <span class="num">1.5</span> * IQR\nust = Q3 + <span class="num">1.5</span> * IQR\n\naykiri_iqr = df[(df[<span class="str">"maas"</span>] < alt) | (df[<span class="str">"maas"</span>] > ust)]\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"IQR sinirlari: [{alt:.0f}, {ust:.0f}]"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"Bulunan aykiri değerler: {len(aykiri_iqr)}"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- Z-SKORU YONTEM\u0130 ----</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"z_skor"</span>] = (df[<span class="str">"maas"</span>] - df[<span class="str">"maas"</span>].<span class="fn">mean</span>()) / df[<span class="str">"maas"</span>].<span class="fn">std</span>()\naykiri_z = df[df[<span class="str">"z_skor"</span>].<span class="fn">abs</span>() > <span class="num">3</span>]\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- KIRPMA (Winsorlama) ----</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"maas_kirpilmis"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"maas"</span>].<span class="fn">clip</span>(lower=alt, upper=ust)\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- YUZDELK TABANLI KIRPMA ----</span>\np01 = df[<span class="str">"maas"</span>].<span class="fn">quantile</span>(<span class="num">0.01</span>)\np99 = df[<span class="str">"maas"</span>].<span class="fn">quantile</span>(<span class="num">0.99</span>)\ndf[<span class="str">"maas_winsor"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"maas"</span>].<span class="fn">clip</span>(lower=p01, upper=p99)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-steps">'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011fer a\u00e7\u0131k\u00e7a bir hata ise kald\u0131r\u0131n</div><div class="step-detail">Negatif ya\u015flar, imkans\u0131z s\u0131cakl\u0131klar veya 100 yerine 10000 yazma gibi veri giri\u015f hatalar\u0131. Bunlar ger\u00e7ek veri noktalar\u0131 de\u011fildir.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011fer ger\u00e7ek ama a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 ise k\u0131rp\u0131n</div><div class="step-detail">350.000 TL\'lik bir maa\u015f ger\u00e7ektir, ancak 50.000 TL ortalamalar\u0131nda e\u011fitilen bir modele hakim olmas\u0131na izin vermek zararl\u0131d\u0131r. K\u0131rpma y\u00f6n\u00fc korurken b\u00fcy\u00fckl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc s\u0131n\u0131rlar.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011fer sinyalin kendisi ise tutun</div><div class="step-detail">Doland\u0131r\u0131c\u0131l\u0131k tespiti, anomali tespiti, nadir hastal\u0131k te\u015fhisi \u2014 ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferler arad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z \u015feyin ta kendisidir. Kald\u0131rmak amac\u0131 bo\u015fa \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131r.</div></div></div>'
