+ '<h2 class="l-title">6. Tam Temizleme Hatt\u0131</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Pratikte asla tek bir temizleme ad\u0131m\u0131 uygulamazs\u0131n\u0131z \u2014 bunlar\u0131 bir <strong>hat</strong> halinde zincirlersiniz. S\u0131ra \u00f6nemlidir: \u00f6nce tipleri d\u00fczelt (say\u0131sal i\u015flemler \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n), sonra null\'lar\u0131 ele al (tip d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrmenin olu\u015fturmu\u015f olabilece\u011fi), sonra tekrarlar\u0131 kald\u0131r, dizeleri temizle ve son olarak ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferleri ele al. \u0130\u015fte tam bir ger\u00e7ek d\u00fcnya \u00f6rne\u011fi.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-steps">'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Veri Tiplerini D\u00fczelt</div><div class="step-detail">Stringleri say\u0131lara d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr, tarihleri ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131r, booleanleri e\u015fle. \u00c7\u00f6kmelerden ka\u00e7\u0131nmak i\u00e7in <code>errors=\'coerce\'</code> kullan\u0131n. Bu ad\u0131m ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lamayan giri\u015flerden yeni NaN de\u011ferleri olu\u015fturur.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Eksik De\u011ferleri Ele Al</div><div class="step-detail">Eksiklik \u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fc de\u011ferlendirin. %50\'den fazla eksik olan s\u00fctunlar\u0131 silin. Say\u0131sal\u0131 medyanla, kategorik verileri modla doldurun.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Tekrarlar\u0131 Kald\u0131r</div><div class="step-detail">\u00d6nce metin s\u00fctunlar\u0131n\u0131 normalize edin (k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck harf, bo\u015fluk temizleme), sonra anahtar s\u00fctunlarda tekrar kontrol\u00fc yap\u0131n. Ka\u00e7 sat\u0131r kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kaydedin.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">4</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Dizeleri Temizle</div><div class="step-detail">Bo\u015fluklar\u0131 temizle, harfleri normalize et, \u00f6zel karakterleri kald\u0131r, formatlar\u0131 standartla\u015ft\u0131r. Karma\u015f\u0131k kal\u0131plar i\u00e7in regex kullan\u0131n.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">5</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Ayk\u0131r\u0131 De\u011ferleri Ele Al</div><div class="step-detail">IQR veya z-skor tespiti uygulay\u0131n. Say\u0131sal \u00f6zellikler i\u00e7in a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferleri k\u0131rp\u0131n. Hangi ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011ferlerin tutulaca\u011f\u0131 vs kald\u0131r\u0131laca\u011f\u0131 kararlar\u0131n\u0131 belgeleyin.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">6</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Do\u011frula</div><div class="step-detail">Dtypes, null say\u0131lar\u0131, tekrar say\u0131lar\u0131 ve de\u011fer aral\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tekrar kontrol edin. K\u0131s\u0131tlamalar\u0131 do\u011frulay\u0131n: negatif ya\u015f yok, ge\u00e7erli email formatlar\u0131, 0\u2013100 aras\u0131 puanlar.</div></div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># ============================================================</span>\n<span class="cm"># ADIM 0: Kirli veriyi yukle</span>\n<span class="cm"># ============================================================</span>\nham = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"isim"</span>:   [<span class="str">"  Ahmet "</span>, <span class="str">"MEHMET"</span>, <span class="str">" zeynep"</span>, <span class="str">"Ayse"</span>, <span class="str">"can"</span>, <span class="str">"MEHMET"</span>, <span class="str">"Ahmet"</span>, <span class="kw">None</span>],\n    <span class="str">"yas"</span>:    [<span class="str">"25"</span>, <span class="str">"30"</span>, <span class="str">"yirmi"</span>, <span class="str">"35"</span>, <span class="str">"22"</span>, <span class="str">"30"</span>, <span class="str">"25"</span>, <span class="str">"40"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"puan"</span>:   [<span class="num">88</span>, <span class="num">72</span>, np.nan, <span class="num">160</span>, <span class="num">91</span>, <span class="num">72</span>, <span class="num">88</span>, np.nan],\n    <span class="str">"email"</span>:  [<span class="str">"Ahmet@Test.COM"</span>, <span class="str">"mehmet@test.com"</span>, <span class="str">"zeynep@test.com"</span>,\n              <span class="str">"N/A"</span>, <span class="str">"can@test.com"</span>, <span class="str">"mehmet@test.com"</span>, <span class="str">"ahmet@test.com"</span>, np.nan],\n    <span class="str">"kayit"</span>:  [<span class="str">"2024-01-15"</span>, <span class="str">"2024-02-20"</span>, <span class="str">"2024/03/10"</span>,\n              <span class="str">"Mart 2024"</span>, <span class="str">"2024-04-01"</span>, <span class="str">"2024-02-20"</span>, <span class="str">"2024-01-15"</span>, <span class="str">"2024-05-01"</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"=== HAM VER\u0130 ==="</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"Boyut: {ham.shape}"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"Null\'lar:\\n{ham.isna().sum()}"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ADIM 1: Tipleri duzelt</span>\ndf = ham.<span class="fn">copy</span>()\ndf[<span class="str">"yas"</span>] = pd.<span class="fn">to_numeric</span>(df[<span class="str">"yas"</span>], errors=<span class="str">"coerce"</span>)\ndf[<span class="str">"kayit"</span>] = pd.<span class="fn">to_datetime</span>(df[<span class="str">"kayit"</span>], errors=<span class="str">"coerce"</span>, format=<span class="str">"mixed"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ADIM 2: Eksik degerleri ele al</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"isim"</span>].<span class="fn">fillna</span>(<span class="str">"Bilinmiyor"</span>, inplace=<span class="kw">True</span>)\ndf[<span class="str">"yas"</span>].<span class="fn">fillna</span>(df[<span class="str">"yas"</span>].<span class="fn">median</span>(), inplace=<span class="kw">True</span>)\ndf[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">fillna</span>(df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">median</span>(), inplace=<span class="kw">True</span>)\ndf[<span class="str">"email"</span>].<span class="fn">fillna</span>(<span class="str">"eksik@na.com"</span>, inplace=<span class="kw">True</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ADIM 3: Dizeleri temizle (tekrar silmeden ONCE!)</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"isim"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"isim"</span>].str.<span class="fn">strip</span>().str.<span class="fn">title</span>()\ndf[<span class="str">"email"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"email"</span>].str.<span class="fn">strip</span>().str.<span class="fn">lower</span>()\ndf[<span class="str">"email"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"email"</span>].<span class="fn">replace</span>(<span class="str">"n/a"</span>, <span class="str">"eksik@na.com"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ADIM 4: Tekrarlari kaldir</span>\nonce_tekrar = <span class="fn">len</span>(df)\ndf = df.<span class="fn">drop_duplicates</span>(subset=[<span class="str">"isim"</span>, <span class="str">"email"</span>], keep=<span class="str">"first"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"Tekrar silme: {once_tekrar} \u2192 {len(df)} satir"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ADIM 5: Aykiri degerleri ele al</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"puan"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">clip</span>(<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">100</span>)\ndf[<span class="str">"yas"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"yas"</span>].<span class="fn">clip</span>(<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">120</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># ADIM 6: Dogrula</span>\n<span class="kw">assert</span> df[<span class="str">"yas"</span>].<span class="fn">between</span>(<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">120</span>).<span class="fn">all</span>(), <span class="str">"Yas aralik disi!"</span>\n<span class="kw">assert</span> df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">between</span>(<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">100</span>).<span class="fn">all</span>(), <span class="str">"Puan aralik disi!"</span>\n<span class="kw">assert</span> df.<span class="fn">duplicated</span>(subset=[<span class="str">"isim"</span>,<span class="str">"email"</span>]).<span class="fn">sum</span>() == <span class="num">0</span>, <span class="str">"Tekrarlar var!"</span>\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">"\\n=== TEM\u0130Z VER\u0130 ==="</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"\\nBoyut: {df.shape}"</span>)</code></pre></div>'

